#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:8
msgid "维护或接入 OS 后端"
msgstr "Maintain or integrate an OS backend"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:10
msgid ""
"已有后端先从 TOML 选择，不为每块板复制 OSAL。新后端必须实现明确的任务、同步、 时间和生命周期合同；不能仅增加 backend "
"名字就宣称支持。当前公共任务、通知、 queue 和 channel 接口由所选后端实现，最终软件候选和硬件资格仍须单独验证。"
msgstr ""
"Select an existing backend through TOML rather than copying OSAL for each "
"Board. A new backend must implement explicit task, synchronization, time and"
" lifecycle contracts; adding a backend name alone does not establish "
"support. The selected backend implements the current common task, "
"notification, queue and channel interfaces. Final software candidates and "
"hardware qualification still require separate validation."

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:14
msgid "确定所需子集"
msgstr "Determine the required subset"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:16
msgid ""
"先列调用方实际需要的静态任务、队列、通知、等待和时间能力。未实现能力明确拒绝； ThreadX 的 Native／M4 子集不继承 FreeRTOS 的"
" tickless、隔离或端口范围。 CPU 原语、SoC 时钟与 OS 内核职责分别维护。"
msgstr ""
"First list the static task, queue, notification, wait and time capabilities "
"actually needed by callers. Reject unimplemented capabilities explicitly. "
"The Native/M4 ThreadX subset does not inherit FreeRTOS tickless, isolation "
"or port scope. Maintain CPU primitives, SoC clocks and OS kernel "
"responsibilities separately."

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:20
msgid ""
"业务头只使用公共 opaque 引用。静态装配包含 `nexus/os/storage.h`，由目标的 include "
"路径选择完整布局；每个可执行文件只链接一个后端。不建立最大 union、 固定 TCB 字节池、运行时 OS 判断或第二层 "
"vtable。裸机保持非阻塞机制，不提供 假任务；要求任务、有限 join 或关闭广播的消费者在能力不足时配置拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"Business headers use only public opaque references. Static assembly includes"
" `nexus/os/storage.h`, with target include paths selecting the complete "
"layout; each executable links one backend. Do not add a maximum union, "
"fixed-byte TCB pool, runtime OS selection or another vtable. Baremetal "
"retains nonblocking mechanisms rather than fake tasks. Reject consumers "
"requiring tasks, finite join or close broadcast at configuration when "
"capabilities are absent."

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:25
msgid "以一条实际路径接入"
msgstr "Integrate one actual path"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:27
msgid "锁定内核、端口、许可证与编译上下文，在 `os/<backend>/` 实现窄 adapter。"
msgstr ""
"Pin the kernel, port, license and compilation context, and implement a "
"narrow adapter in `os/<backend>/`."

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:28
msgid ""
"完成公共 struct 标签及真实选定布局；调用者清零控制对象，提供字节栈容量和完整 payload 容量。准入检查完整跨度、对齐和重叠，不仅检查有效 "
"item 区间。"
msgstr ""
"Complete public struct tags and actual selected layouts. Callers zero "
"controls and provide byte-sized stack capacity and complete payload "
"capacity. Admission checks full spans, alignment and overlap, not merely the"
" used item range."

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:30
msgid ""
"实现共同符号及同域绝对单调 deadline；映射高数值高优先级，分离 Task／ISR 入口，拒绝非法上下文，不忽略 Native "
"无法提供的优先级保证。"
msgstr ""
"Implement common symbols and absolute monotonic deadlines in one domain. Map"
" higher numeric logical priorities to higher priority, separate Task/ISR "
"entry points and reject invalid contexts. Do not ignore priority guarantees "
"Native cannot provide."

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:32
msgid "验证真实任务执行、部分创建失败、通知竞争、超时、关闭和失败排空。"
msgstr ""
"Validate actual task execution, partial-creation failures, notification "
"races, timeouts, close and failed drain."

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:33
msgid "编译所维护的 CPU／ABI 组合，再单独记录 MCU 上下文、栈峰值和时序实测。"
msgstr ""
"Compile maintained CPU/ABI combinations, then separately record MCU context,"
" stack peaks and measured timing."

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:35
msgid ""
"应用拥有 scheduler 启动和产品 worker。Platform start 不进入内核；任务入口返回 或通知到达不授权回收 "
"stack／TCB。内核仍使用的 Tick、时钟和 IRQ 必须保留。 公共 `nx_os_run` 通过真实 bootstrap "
"启动，成功不返回；Native 在回调后停驻原调用 线程以保留其栈。`nx_task_join_until` 成功必须证明真实内核引用撤离，有限 "
"join 不能退成无界调用。Native 要求可真实链接的 GNU monotonic clock-join 能力。"
msgstr ""
"Applications own scheduler startup and product workers. Platform start does "
"not enter the kernel. Task-entry return or notification arrival does not "
"authorize stack/TCB reclamation. Retain Tick, clocks and IRQs still used by "
"the kernel. Common `nx_os_run` enters actual bootstrap and never returns "
"successfully; Native subsequently parks the original calling thread to "
"retain its stack. Successful `nx_task_join_until` must prove actual kernel "
"reference withdrawal; finite join must not fall back to an unbounded call. "
"Native requires genuinely linked GNU monotonic clock-join support."

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:41
msgid "与配置和构建组合"
msgstr "Compose with configuration and builds"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:43
msgid ""
"后端的能力与策略字段进入公开合同和 typed IR，实际 CMake 目标发布为所选 "
"`Nexus::OS`。新增后端同时维护兼容性事实、依赖选择、生成、Source SDK profile 和实际消费者，不创建第二套实例或源码图。 "
"配置工具处理能力与静态选择，不实现内核行为。复用同一 CPU／port 合同的新 MCU 提供相应 SoC、时钟和 IRQ 事实，不复制公共 OS "
"API 或逐芯片增加行为分支。"
msgstr ""
"Backend capabilities and policy fields enter public contracts and typed IR, "
"while the actual CMake target is published as the selected `Nexus::OS`. A "
"new backend maintains compatibility facts, dependency selection, generation,"
" Source SDK profiles and actual consumers together, without a second "
"instance or source graph. Configuration tools validate capabilities and "
"static selection rather than implement kernel behavior. An MCU reusing the "
"same CPU/port contract provides its SoC, clock and IRQ facts instead of "
"copying public OS APIs or adding per-chip behavior branches."

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:49
msgid ""
"消费者在显式调用 `nexus_add_platform` 或 `nexus_add_runtime`、并建立应用 target "
"后声明必要能力。下面是片段，假定装配和 `app` 已存在，不是完整工程："
msgstr ""
"Consumers declare required capabilities after explicitly calling "
"`nexus_add_platform` or `nexus_add_runtime` and creating the application "
"target. The following is a fragment assuming the assembly and `app` already "
"exist, not a complete project:"

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:58
msgid ""
"该函数只校验选定 `Nexus::OS` 的能力元数据，不隐式添加链接。缺失能力、拼写错误、 尚未选择装配或不存在的应用 target "
"都在配置阶段失败。CMake 的 compatible-interface 约束另行拒绝同一可执行文件链接两个 task 后端，不依靠运行时发现冲突。"
msgstr ""
"This function only validates capability metadata on the selected "
"`Nexus::OS`; it does not link implicitly. Missing capabilities, spelling "
"errors, no selected assembly or a nonexistent application target fail during"
" configuration. CMake compatible-interface constraints separately reject two"
" task backends linked into one executable, without runtime conflict "
"detection."

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:62
msgid ""
"Native 不提供 `priority` 或硬件 `isr_notify`；Host ThreadX 不提供硬件 `isr_notify`； "
"裸机仅声明 `wait`，不能接纳要求 task-profile 的消费者。task-profile 是能力集合的 说明，不是新增 TOML "
"字段。配置与源码仍沿同一目标图维护。实际回归入口为 "
"[`test_platform_entry.py`](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/testing/test_platform_entry.py)，不能仅凭此片段 "
"宣称另一个后端或目标已验证。"
msgstr ""
"Native provides neither `priority` nor hardware `isr_notify`; Host ThreadX "
"provides no hardware `isr_notify`. Baremetal declares only `wait` and cannot"
" admit consumers requiring a task-profile. Here task-profile describes a "
"capability set, not a new TOML field. Configuration and source remain in the"
" same target graph. Actual regressions are maintained in "
"[`test_platform_entry.py`](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/testing/test_platform_entry.py); the fragment "
"alone does not establish validation of another backend or target."

#: ../../../../docs/guides/os-backend-porting.md:68
msgid ""
"详细 port、IRQ ceiling、Tick 和错误语义集中在 "
"[后端集成合同](../reference/contracts/os/backend-integration.md)。应用停机见 [OS 停止](os-"
"shutdown.md)，生产变更按[开发流程](../development/workflow.md)执行。"
msgstr ""
"Detailed port, IRQ-ceiling, Tick and error semantics are centralized in the "
"[backend integration contract](../reference/contracts/os/backend-"
"integration.md). See [OS shutdown](os-shutdown.md) for application shutdown "
"and follow the [development workflow](../development/workflow.md) for "
"production changes."
